ebm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two Loadouts fight the same in Shotball. With unique abilities, perks, and ultimates, you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">can tailor your loadout to match your playstyle, from agile goal-scorers to heavy-hitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">enforcers. Adapt your class, counter your rivals, and find your perfect strategy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/extras/1dda17dab48df17dee3f862cca1edbbf.webp?t=1783331403\" width=1140 height=53 /></span></p>", "short_description": "An adrenaline-pumping 3v3 class-based shooter sport game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/header.jpg?t=1783331403", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/61d60b64e54b104adcec9982340e97f813204787/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783331403", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941100/61d60b64e54b104adcec9982340e97f813204787/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783331403", "website": "https://holo.gg", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64 bit-version only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200, intel core i5 4460<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1080, Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"b